{
 "content": [
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "When recommending movies, Netflix cares about estimating the probability that a user will like a given movie, based on their viewing history. In order to make this problem tractable, they classify movies into a (large number) of specific genres such a \"Tearjerker\" or \"Quirky Romance\".",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "The probability that a Netflix user likes a movie ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_i"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " from the \"Tearjerker\" genre: ",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Given that they like the Tearjerker genre is ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "p_i = 0.4"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ". ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "text": "Given that they do not like the Tearjerker genre is ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "q_i = 0.9"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ". ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "type": "hardBreak"
    },
    {
     "text": "60% of Netflix users like the Tearjerker genre. ",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Netflix assumes that, given a user’s preference for the genre, liking movie ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_i"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " and ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_j"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " are conditionally independent events for any movies ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "i"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " and ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "j"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ". You may express all your answers in terms of ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "q"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": "s and ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "p"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": "s. ",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "id": null,
    "level": "3",
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "Questions",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "heading"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "What is the probability that a user likes movies ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_1"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ", ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_2"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " and ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_3"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " given that they like the Tearjerker genre?",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "content": [
    {
     "attrs": {
      "rawTex": "\\begin{aligned}\np_1 \\cdot p_2 \\cdot p_3\n\\end{aligned}"
     },
     "type": "block-tex"
    }
   ],
   "type": "purpleBox"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "What is the probability that they like movies ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_1"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ", ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_2"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " or ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_3"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " given that they like the Tearjerker genre?",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "content": [
    {
     "attrs": {
      "textAlign": "left"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Let ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "showEditor": false,
        "value": "L_i |G"
       },
       "type": "math_inline"
      },
      {
       "text": " be the event that they like movie ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "showEditor": false,
        "value": "T_i"
       },
       "type": "math_inline"
      },
      {
       "text": " given that they like the Tearjerker genre. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "rawTex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Answer} \n&= \\P(L_1|G \\or L_2|G \\or L_3|G) \\\\\n&= 1−P(L_1|G \\or L_2|G \\or L_3|G)^C \\\\\n&= 1−P(L_1^C|G \\and L_2^C |G \\and L_3^C  |G) \\\\\n&= 1−(1− p_1)(1− p_2)(1− p_3) \n\\end{aligned}"
     },
     "type": "block-tex"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "textAlign": "left"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Another approach is to use the inclusion/exclusion principle to expand the first line of the previous answer: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "rawTex": "\\begin{aligned}\n\\text{Answer} \n&= P(L1|G \\or L2|G \\or L3|G)\\\\\n&= p_1 + p_2 + p_3 \n−(p_1\\cdot p_2)\n−(p_1\\cdot p_3)\n−(p_2 \\cdot p_3) \n+ (p_1 \\cdot p_2 \\cdot p_3) \n\\end{aligned}"
     },
     "type": "block-tex"
    }
   ],
   "type": "purpleBox"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "text": "What is the probability that they like the Tearjerker genre given that they like ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_1"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ", ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_2"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": " and ",
     "type": "text"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "showEditor": false,
      "value": "T_3"
     },
     "type": "math_inline"
    },
    {
     "text": ".",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "type": "paragraph"
  },
  {
   "content": [
    {
     "attrs": {
      "rawTex": "\\begin{aligned}\nP(G& \\mid L_1 L_2 L_3) \\\\\n&= \\frac{P(L_1 L_2 L_3 \\mid G) P(G)}{P(L_1 L_2 L_3 \\mid G) P(G) + P(L_1 L_2 L_3 \\mid G^C) P(G^C)} \\\\\n&= \\frac{(p_1 p_2 p_3)(0.6)}{(p_1 p_2 p_3)(0.6) + (q_1 q_2 q_3)(0.4)}\n\\end{aligned}"
     },
     "type": "block-tex"
    }
   ],
   "type": "purpleBox"
  },
  {
   "attrs": {
    "textAlign": "left"
   },
   "type": "paragraph"
  }
 ],
